cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "backcalc: Reconstruct Missing Inferential Statistics"
authors:
  - family-names: "Wendorf"
    given-names: "Craig A."
    email: "cwendorf@uwsp.edu"
version: "0.260407"
license: "MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cwendorf/backcalc"
url: "https://github.com/cwendorf/backcalc"
abstract: >-
  This package provides functions to reconstruct key inferential statistics
  such as standard errors, confidence intervals, test statistics, and p-values
  from partial or incomplete summary information commonly reported in
  scientific literature.
